      <div class="eb">Hold Beauty · suprimentos · documento de revisão</div>
      <h1 class="disp">REGRAS DE NEGÓCI<span class="od"><span class="sr">O</span><svg viewBox="0 0 130.3 100" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M130.3 50Q130.3 66.7 123.6 77.7Q116.8 88.8 102.4 94.4Q88 100 65.2 100Q42.3 100 27.9 94.4Q13.5 88.8 6.7 77.7Q0 66.7 0 50Q0 33.3 6.7 22.2Q13.5 11 27.9 5.5Q42.3 0 65.2 0Q88 0 102.4 5.5Q116.8 11 123.6 22.2Q130.3 33.3 130.3 50ZM101.3 50Q101.3 45.6 99.5 42.8Q97.8 40 94.6 38.4Q91.4 36.9 86.9 36.2Q82.3 35.6 76.8 35.6H53.5Q48 35.6 43.5 36.2Q39.1 36.9 35.8 38.4Q32.5 40 30.8 42.8Q29 45.6 29 50Q29 54.4 30.8 57.2Q32.5 60 35.8 61.6Q39.1 63.1 43.5 63.8Q48 64.4 53.5 64.4H76.8Q82.3 64.4 86.9 63.8Q91.4 63.1 94.6 61.6Q97.8 60 99.5 57.2Q101.3 54.4 101.3 50Z"/></svg></span></h1>
      <p class="sub">Tudo o que a torre de estoque assume para dizer que um produto está em risco —
